<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Nampak buys BlowMocan for 2 million stg.</title>
<headline>Nampak buys BlowMocan for 2 million stg.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nampak Ltd said on Wednesday it had bought the remaining 50 percent of BlowMocan from the other joint venture shareholder Rexam Plc for 2 million pounds sterling.  </p>
<p>Nampak and Rexam entered into the BlowMocan joint venture in February 1995 in order to combine and grow their interests in blow moulded beverage containers.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
